Important — content license (NOT covered by the MIT grant above):

The Chinese source text in `public/content/*.json` is taken from 人民出版社
1991 年第 2 版《毛泽东选集》. This is public-domain source material in
the People's Republic of China as of the time of transcription, but the
rights status has not been re-confirmed for online distribution outside
China. Before distributing the app or a derivative build outside the
research / non-commercial envelope, see `docs/content-release-audit.md` and
obtain a written authorization or a jurisdiction-specific legal opinion.

The English translations in `public/content/*.json` under
`translations.en` are LLM-generated drafts (`status: draft`). They are NOT
the Foreign Languages Press edition (which remains under US copyright until
2049). They are released for review use only and may not be redistributed
as a published translation.
